                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game just doesn't direct you at all.  A good escape room gives you a specific starting point and everything leads on from there.  This is pretty random.  Like the first room where you have to have a 5 letter work to move on.  Once you've found the letters, you just have to make random guesses at words.  There should be something in the room that links the letter to a word but nope.  The 2nd room I managed to find a power switch and a key and put the QR codes on the mainframe but nothing happened.  I spent the entire time wandering aimlessly around the room.  There is no clue/hint system, but mostly fails due to lack of breadcrumbs.  Most escape rooms are better than this.",
